{"page":92,"verses":[{"verse_key":"4:87","surah":4,"ayah":87,"ar_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ ۚ لَيَجْمَعَنَّكُمْ إِلَىٰ يَوْمِ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ لَا رَيْبَ فِيهِ ۗ وَمَنْ أَصْدَقُ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ حَدِيثًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He is God: there is no god but Him. He will gather you all together on the Day of Resurrection, about which there is no doubt. Whose word can be truer than God’s?","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"al-lahu","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَآ","en_gloss":"(there is) no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","en_gloss":"god","transliteration":"ilāha","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"هُوَ ۚ","en_gloss":"Him","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَيَجْمَعَنَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"surely He will gather you","transliteration":"layajmaʿannakum","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(the) Day","transliteration":"yawmi","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) Resurrection ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":11,"ar":"رَيْبَ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"rayba","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِيهِ ۗ","en_gloss":"about it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَمَنْ","en_gloss":"And who","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَصْدَقُ","en_gloss":"(is) more truthful","transliteration":"aṣdaqu","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"than","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":17,"ar":"حَدِيثًۭا","en_gloss":"(in) statement","transliteration":"ḥadīthan","verse_key":"4:87"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٨٧","en_gloss":"(87)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:87"}]},{"verse_key":"4:88","surah":4,"ayah":88,"ar_uthmani":"۞ فَمَا لَكُمْ فِى ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ فِئَتَيْنِ وَٱللَّهُ أَرْكَسَهُم بِمَا كَسَبُوٓا۟ ۚ أَتُرِيدُونَ أَن تَهْدُوا۟ مَنْ أَضَلَّ ٱللَّهُ ۖ وَمَن يُضْلِلِ ٱللَّهُ فَلَن تَجِدَ لَهُۥ سَبِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Believers], why are you divided in two about the hypocrites, when God Himself has rejected them because of what they have done? Do you want to guide those God has left to stray? If God leaves anyone to stray, you [Prophet] will never find the way for him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ فَمَا","en_gloss":"So what","transliteration":"famā","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is the matter) with you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the hypocrites (that)","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فِئَتَيْنِ","en_gloss":"(you have become) two parties","transliteration":"fi-atayni","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"While Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَرْكَسَهُم","en_gloss":"cast them back","transliteration":"arkasahum","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"for what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَسَبُوٓا۟ ۚ","en_gloss":"they earned","transliteration":"kasabū","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَتُرِيدُونَ","en_gloss":"Do you wish","transliteration":"aturīdūna","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَهْدُوا۟","en_gloss":"you guide","transliteration":"tahdū","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":14,"ar":"أَضَلَّ","en_gloss":"is let astray","transliteration":"aḍalla","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":15,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":17,"ar":"يُضْلِلِ","en_gloss":"is let astray","transliteration":"yuḍ'lili","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"(by) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فَلَن","en_gloss":"then never","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":20,"ar":"تَجِدَ","en_gloss":"will you find","transliteration":"tajida","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":21,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"for him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":22,"ar":"سَبِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"a way","transliteration":"sabīlan","verse_key":"4:88"},{"pos":23,"ar":"٨٨","en_gloss":"(88)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"4:88"}]},{"verse_key":"4:89","surah":4,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"وَدُّوا۟ لَوْ تَكْفُرُونَ كَمَا كَفَرُوا۟ فَتَكُونُونَ سَوَآءً ۖ فَلَا تَتَّخِذُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ أَوْلِيَآءَ حَتَّىٰ يُهَاجِرُوا۟ فِى سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ فَإِن تَوَلَّوْا۟ فَخُذُوهُمْ وَٱقْتُلُوهُمْ حَيْثُ وَجَدتُّمُوهُمْ ۖ وَلَا تَتَّخِذُوا۟ مِنْهُمْ وَلِيًّا وَلَا نَصِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They would dearly like you to reject faith, as they themselves have done, to be like them. So do not take them as allies until they migrate [to Medina] for God’s cause. If they turn [on you], then seize and kill them wherever you encounter them. Take none of them as an ally or supporter.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"They wish","transliteration":"waddū","verse_key":"4:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"4:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"you disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurūna","verse_key":"4:89"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"4:89"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"they disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"4:89"},{"pos":6,"